# Local dictionary extensions for Foyer FreeRADIUS 3.2.x
#
# Loaded by radiusd as a dictionary, from ${raddbdir}/dictionary. It is not
# $INCLUDEd by radiusd.conf, and must not be: that would parse these lines as
# configuration.
#
# Numbers 3000-4000 are FreeRADIUS's range for attributes that are defined here
# and NEVER put into a RADIUS packet. That is the property the one below needs.
#
# Foyer-Identity-Kind is what the Policy API's allow says still has to be proven
# (internal/aaa.IdentityKindAttribute): `voucher` -- the code was the credential
# and nothing further is checked -- or `account` -- the password must still be
# verified by rlm_pap against radius_pap_verifiers. It arrives in the reply list
# from rlm_rest, sites-available/default decides on it and then deletes it, and
# it would not be encoded even if it were left. Measured on 3.2.10.
ATTRIBUTE	Foyer-Identity-Kind	3000	string
